   "id": "below-fold",
   "width": 1440,
   "message": "Only 1 of 4 blocks start on the first 1440px screen.",
   "fix": "Every block the brief names shows its header and first rows on the first desktop screen: size the headline block to its question, cap long lists with \"View all\", and put time-sensitive blocks before long tables."
