   "id": "panel-void",
   "width": 1440,
   "message": "1 card(s) hold a blank band inside: 88px in \"cooling · be careful\".",
   "fix": "A card stretches to its neighbour only when it has content to fill. Keep a legend or a note directly under its chart (only an action or a total may sit at a stretched card's foot), let a short card keep its own height (align-items: start), and let a filtered block shrink to its rows."
